entityDescription:
Freelance
Advice to enterprises (particularly SMEs) concerning the following areas:
a &ndash; R&D and EU Territorial Cooperation programs
- Identify calls for funded R&D projects within European, national and regional programmes, for the development of research activities in boatbuilding and nautical fields;
- Identify calls for territorial cooperation for the development of collaborative projects mainly within the Adriatic-Ionian macroregion;
b - Diversification and differentiation of enterprises activities
- Support entrepreneurship, especially in the boat building sector, for application of their skills in new sector markets;
- Identify industrial demands within interdisciplinary networks in order to offer available solutions already developed in the boatbuilding sector.
c - Promoting SMEs internationalization
- Supportthe export promotion and marketing efforts of SMEs, by providing information and assistance to international trade-fairs and trade missions. 
d - network manager
- Govern relations between all actors of the network (internal communications);
- Harmonize the various interests involved and coordinate the activities of the individual;
- Coordinate the development of the commercial network;
- Develop strategies, plans and initiatives of the organization;
- Treat analysis of the needs of members and promote the achievement of the business objectives of the members;
- Contribute to the defense of the interests of the network to third parties.

